{"articleNo":"193449","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=193449&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제] 2018 한·중·일 3국 대학생 외교캠프 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.06.08","hit":"5028","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">외교부에서는 한·중·일 3국 대학생 간 교류를 통해 3국 미래세대 간 신뢰 구축 및 3국 협력의 저변을 확대 강화하고자 아래와 같이 2018 한·중·일 3국 대학생 외교캠프를 개최할 예정입니다.&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null\">관심있는 본교 학생들의 많은&nbsp;지원 부탁드립니다</span></font><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">. </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span><font color=\"#5d5d5d\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">일시 및 장소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: 2018.7.17.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">) ~ 20(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">전라남도 순천</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">~</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">여수 일대</span></font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">참여대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">한중일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">국 협력에 관심이 있는 한국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">중국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">일본 대학생</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">접수기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: 2018.6.24.(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">까지</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">참가방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">온라인 접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">(<a href=\"http://www.cafe.naver.com/mofacamp\">www.cafe.naver.com/mofacamp</a>)</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">외교캠프 온라인 카페 내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">참가신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">’ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">메뉴를 통한 온라인 접수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">자세한 내용은 홈페이지 참조)</span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">문의처</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">외교캠프 사무국 </span></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (0</span></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">70-4367-1226&nbsp;/ <a href=\"mailto:mofacamofacamp2018@naver.com\">mofacamofacamp2018@naver.com</a>)</span></font><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#5d5d5d\"></font>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://kumoh.ac.kr/upload/8bcaa1f2-b018-4b32-9103-38821c288d56.jpg\"> \n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
